      "title": "PF vocabulary",
      "links": [],
      "rules": [
        {
          "text": "TF: the Toxic Friends raidplan, the one PF usually means.",
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Kindred No Buddies: the Kindred Flatliner strat.",
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Toxic No Buddies: the Toxic Friends Flatliner strat.",
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "text": "No Buddies: \"buddies\" was an early Flatliner strat where the prey players paired up on tethers and mirrored their tower knockbacks. No Buddies means not doing that.",
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "text": "PTT / TTT / PPP ...: order of the tower soaks at the end of the fight, P = party, T = tank (PTT = Party, Tank, Tank).",
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Uptime ES / Fixed ES: the two strats for Ecliptic Stampede (the two-fold / four-fold fire mechanic); raidplans below.",
          "scenarios": []
        }
      ]
    },
